===Alternative forms===
* ''[[Mahomet]]'' was the predominant form until the 1700s. ''[[Mohammed]]''<!--gets 7.4mil BGC hits--> was the predominant form from the 1700s until the 1940s, when it was overtaken by ''Muhammad'', which has been the predominant form ever since. Other very common forms are ''[[Mohamed]]''<!--4.8mil-->, ''[[Muhamad]]''<!--3.8mil-->, ''[[Mohammad]]''<!--3.7mil-->{{,}} and ''[[Muhammed]]''<!--1.3mil-->, which all came into widespread use after 1820.
* {{qualifier|other common forms:}} [[Mahomed]]<!--723k-->, [[Mehemet]], [[Mahommed]]<!--136k+ -->, [[Mohamad]]<!--663k-->, [[Muhamed]]<!--241k-->, [[Muhammat]]<!--159k-->
* {{qualifier|other common forms:}} [[Mehemed]], [[Mehemmed]], [[Mahoma]]; [[Muhammud]], [[Mahemet]], [[Mehemmet]]
* {{qualifier|Ottoman/Turkish variants:}} [[Mehmed]], [[Mehmet]]
{{rel-top|less common forms}}
